/a></li><li style="padding-left:0.75rem" class="flex items-start gap-2"><div class="bg-foreground mt-[0.5rem] h-1 w-1 flex-shrink-0 transition-opacity opacity-0"></div><a href="#evolution-of-the-modern-games" class="transition-opacity hover:opacity-100 opacity-50">Evolution of the Modern Games</a></li><li style="padding-left:1.5rem" class="flex items-start gap-2"><div class="bg-foreground mt-[0.5rem] h-1 w-1 flex-shrink-0 transition-opacity opacity-0"></div><a href="#20th-century-expansion-and-adaptations" class="transition-opacity hover:opacity-100 opacity-50">20th-Century Expansion and Adaptations</a></li><li style="padding-left:1.5rem" class="flex items-start gap-2"><div class="bg-foreground mt-[0.5rem] h-1 w-1 flex-shrink-0 transition-opacity opacity-0"></div><a href="#introduction-of-winter-olympics" class="transition-opacity hover:opacity-100 opacity-50">Introduction of Winter Olympics</a></li><li style="padding-left:1.5rem" class="flex items-start gap-2"><div class="bg-foreground mt-[0.5rem] h-1 w-1 flex-shrink-0 transition-opacity opacity-0"></div><a href="#development-of-paralympics-and-youth-games" class="transition-opacity hover:opacity-100 opacity-50">Development of Paralympics and Youth Games</a></li><li style="padding-left:1.5rem" class="flex items-start gap-2"><div class="bg-foreground mt-[0.5rem] h-1 w-1 flex-shrink-0 transition-opacity opacity-0"></div><a href="#21st-century-reforms-and-innovations" class="transition-opacity hover:opacity-100 opacity-50">21st-Century Reforms and Innovations</a></li><li style="padding-left:0.75rem" class="flex items-start gap-2"><div class="bg-foreground mt-[0.5rem] h-1 w-1 flex-shrink-0 transition-opacity opacity-0"></div><a href="#governance-and-administration" class="transition-opacity hover:opacity-100 opacity-50">Governance and Administration</a></li><li style="padding-left:1.5rem" class="flex items-start gap-2"><div class="bg-foreground mt-[0.5rem] h-1 w-1 flex-shrink-0 transition-opacity opacity-0"></div><a hr