iation of Summer Olympic ...\",\"url\":\"https://www.wada-ama.org/en/anti-doping-partners/international-federations\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"96\",\"title\":\"IFs and NOCs strongly support fight against competition ...\",\"description\":\"Jul 24, 2021 · IFs and National Olympic Committees (NOCs) across the globe have worked closely with the International Olympic Committee (IOC) to help ensure fair competitions.\",\"url\":\"https://olympics.com/ioc/news/ifs-and-nocs-strongly-support-fight-against-competition-manipulation-at-tokyo-2020\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"97\",\"title\":\"The process to elect Olympic hosts\",\"description\":\"The process is overseen by two permanent Future Host Commissions, one for Summer and one for Winter Games.\",\"url\":\"https://olympics.com/ioc/becoming-an-olympic-games-host/the-process-to-elect-olympic-hosts\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"98\",\"title\":\"[PDF] OLYMPIC AGENDA 2020\",\"description\":\"Reduce the cost of bidding. The IOC to further assist Candidate Cities and reduce the cost of bidding. 1. The Candidate Cities to be allowed to attend and ...\",\"url\":\"https://stillmed.olympic.org/Documents/Olympic_Agenda_2020/Olympic_Agenda_2020-20-20_Recommendations-ENG.pdf\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"99\",\"title\":\"Olympic Agenda 2020 drives progress and change\",\"description\":\"Dec 11, 2020 · - Olympic Agenda 2020 reforms have deepened the confidence and trust that our commercial partners are placing in us, resulting in financial ...\",\"url\":\"https://olympics.com/ioc/news/olympic-agenda-2020-drives-progress-and-change\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"100\",\"title\":\"Organising Committees for the Olympic Games\",\"description\":\"The organisation of the Olympic Games is entrusted by the International Olympic Committee (IOC) to the National Olympic Committee (NOC) of the country of the ...\",\"url\":\"https://www.olympics.com/ioc/olympic-games-organising-committees\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"101\",\"title\":\"Who organises the Olympic Games?\",\"description\":\"The host city's Organising Committee for the Olympic Games (OCOG) is in charge of organising this great event. When the International Olympic Committee ...\",\"url\":\"https://www.olympics.com/ioc/faq/games-ceremonies-and-protocol/who-organises-the-olympic-games\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"102\",\"title\":\"How Big Is Cost Overrun for the Olympics? | by Bent Flyvbjerg\",\"description\":\"Jul 14, 2021 · The Olympic Games have the highest average cost overrun of any type of megaproject, at 172 percent in real terms.Missing:  empirical | Show results with:empirical\",\"url\":\"https://medium.com/data-science/how-big-is-cost-overrun-for-the-olympics-46e803cbf7d5\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"103\",\"title\":\"(PDF) The Oxford Olympics Study 2024: Are Cost and Cost Overrun ...\",\"description\":\"We document that the Games remain costly and continue to have large cost overruns, to a degree that threatens their viability.\",\"url\":\"https://www.researchgate.net/publication/381157992_The_Oxford_Olympics_Study_2024_Are_Cost_and_Cost_Overrun_at_the_Games_Coming_Down\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"104\",\"title\":\"The structural deficit of the Olympics and the World Cup - NIH\",\"description\":\"May 31, 2022 · This article compares the revenues and costs of the Olympic Games and World Cups between 1964 and 2018 (N = 43), together totalling close to USD 70 billion in ...\",\"url\":\"https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC9272517/\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"105\",\"title\":\"[PDF] IOC-Marketing-Fact-File.pdf - Olympics.com\",\"description\":\"The Olympic Movement generates revenue through several programmes. The IOC manages broadcast partnerships, the. TOP worldwide sponsorship programme and the IOC ...\",\"url\":\"https://stillmed.olympics.com/media/Documents/International-Olympic-Committee/IOC-Marketing-And-Broadcasting/IOC-Marketing-Fact-File.pdf\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"106\",\"title\":\"\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\"