13, 2024 · The added sports for the 2028 Olympics in Los Angeles are: baseball/softball, flag football, lacrosse and squash. Stretching the definition of ...\",\"url\":\"https://www.espn.com/olympics/story/_/id/40839738/forgotten-olympic-sports-summer-winter-games\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"165\",\"title\":\"List of Discontinued Sports and Events of the Summer Olympics\",\"description\":\"Since the first modern Games in 1896, 10 sports have disappeared completely from the Olympic schedule. These are croquet, cricket, Jeu de Paume, pelota, ...\",\"url\":\"https://www.topendsports.com/events/discontinued/list.htm\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"166\",\"title\":\"7 Canceled or Reintroduced Olympic Sports - Britannica\",\"description\":\"In 2012, however, both baseball and softball were dropped from the Olympic ticket, the first time since 1936 that the IOC shrank the number of sports.\",\"url\":\"https://www.britannica.com/list/7-canceled-or-reintroduced-olympic-sports\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"167\",\"title\":\"For Love or For Money: A History of Amateurism in the Olympic Games\",\"description\":\"Jun 7, 2016 · And thus when the games began in 1896, participation was limited to athletes who did not receive any financial compensation for his or her ...\",\"url\":\"https://www.vice.com/en/article/for-love-or-for-money-a-history-of-amateurism-in-the-olympic-games/\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"168\",\"title\":\"Olympic amateurism from de Coubertin to Samaranch\",\"description\":\"Feb 23, 2017 · Amateurism was instituted in the first games, held in 1896 in Athens, but there was no way to enforce the policy and the next two Olympics, ...\",\"url\":\"https://idrottsforum.org/raysus_llewellyn-gleaves170223/\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"169\",\"title\":\"The Olympics Games: An amateur affair or professional goal?\",\"description\":\"May 10, 2021 · The issue of professionals and amateurs has been at the core of the modern Olympic Games since 1896 ... Cold War Love Story 