rom-hero-to-zero-in-100m-disgrace\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"212\",\"title\":\"Marion Jones disqualified - Olympic News\",\"description\":\"Dec 11, 2007 · The EB also decided that Marion Jones is ineligible for the 2008 Beijing Olympic Games, not only as an athlete but also in any other capacity.Missing:  scandal | Show results with:scandal\",\"url\":\"https://olympics.com/ioc/news/marion-jones-disqualified\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"213\",\"title\":\"WADA Statement: Independent Investigation confirms Russian State ...\",\"description\":\"Jul 18, 2016 · On 18 May, WADA engaged Professor McLaren, as an Independent Person, to investigate allegations of Russian state manipulation of the doping control process.\u003c|separator|\u003e\",\"url\":\"https://www.wada-ama.org/en/news/wada-statement-independent-investigation-confirms-russian-state-manipulation-doping-control\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"214\",\"title\":\"More Than 1000 Russian Athletes Involved In Doping Conspiracy ...\",\"description\":\"Dec 9, 2016 · There was a \\\"systematic and centralised cover up and manipulation of the doping control process\\\" in Russia, an investigation found.\",\"url\":\"https://www.npr.org/sections/thetwo-way/2016/12/09/504937994/more-than-1-000-russian-athletes-benefited-from-doping-conspiracy-report-says\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"215\",\"title\":\"[PDF] Contamination case of swimmers from China Fact Sheet / Frequently ...\",\"description\":\"Apr 29, 2024 · 23 Chinese swimmers tested positive for trimetazidine (TMZ) due to environmental/food contamination, with 28 positive samples found. This was ...\",\"url\":\"https://www.wada-ama.org/sites/default/files/2024-04/2024-04_fact_sheet_faq_chinese_swimming.pdf\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"216\",\"title\":\"Olympic Testing - WADA and the IOC Fight Against Doping\",\"description\":\"Since March 2016, it has delegated the decisions on alleged anti-doping rule violations during the Games to an independent body, namely a new Anti-Doping ...\",\"url\":\"https://www.olympics.com/ioc/fight-against-doping\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"217\",\"title\":\"World Anti-Doping Agency - Olympics.com\",\"description\":\"The World Anti-Doping Agency (WADA) was established on 10 November 1999. Its mission is to promote and coordinate the fight against doping in sport ...\",\"url\":\"https://www.olympics.com/ioc/wada\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"218\",\"title\":\"Infographic: Doping at the Olympic Games - past, present and future\",\"description\":\"Gene doping and genomic science in sports: where are we? Antidoping analysis: a special focus · Virtual drug testing: redefining sample collection in a global ...Missing:  major | Show results with:major\",\"url\":\"https://www.bioanalysis-zone.com/infographics/infographic-doping-at-the-olympic-games-past-present-and-future/\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"219\",\"title\":\"Transwoman Elite Athletes: Their Extra Percentage Relative to ... - NIH\",\"description\":\"Jul 26, 2022 · Male physiology underpins their better athletic performance including increased muscle mass and strength, stronger bones, different skeletal ...\",\"url\":\"https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC9331831/\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"220\",\"title\":\"Testosterone and Beyond: The Male Advantage - Paradox Institute\",\"description\":\"The male sports performance advantage ranges from 10-50%, and testosterone suppression reduces the muscle mass and strength that accounts for a majority of this ...\",\"url\":\"https://theparadoxinstitute.org/watch/testosterone-and-beyond-the-male-advantage\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"221\",\"title\":\"Two new scientific reviews agree that transwomen athletes retain ...\",\"description\":\"Mar 7, 2021 · The two studies arrive at the same conclusion: male athletes suppressing testosterone in order to transition lose little in the way of muscle mass and strength.\",\"url\":\"https://sex-matters.org/posts/sport/a-new-review-of-retained-performance-in-transwomen/\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"222\",\"title\":\"Imane Khelif gender controversy sparks up again after ... - Fox News\",\"description\":\"Jun 2, 2025 · Algerian Olympic gold medalist Imane Khelif was thrust into a new gender controversy as a new report shed light on medical results from 2022 ...\u003c|separator|\u003e\",\"url\":\"https://www.foxnews.com/sports/gender-controversy-swirls-around-olympic-gold-medalist-after-new-report-sheds-light-medical-tests\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"223\",\"title\":\"Olympic boxer Imane Khelif fights back as boxing association files ...\",\"description\":\"Feb 12, 2025 · Khelif, who has always competed as a woman, was banned by the IBA from the 2023 world championships after a sex chromosome test that the IBA ...\",\"url\":\"https://www.nbcnews.com/nbc-out/out-news/olympic-boxer-imane-khelif-fights-back-boxing-association-files-suit-g-rcna191917\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"224\",\"title\":\"Testosterone suppression in sport: time to drop the Roberts study\",\"description\":\"Jan 24, 2023 · Testosterone suppression is largely discredited, with seventeen published papers showing that it does not remove male advantage, even after many years.\",\"url\":\"https://fairplayforwomen.com/testosterone-suppression-in-sport-time-to-drop-the-roberts-study/\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"225\",\"title\":\"IOC Executive Board approves 11 athletes' changes of sporting ...\",\"description\":\"Jun 13, 2024 · Samalulu Clifton – Canoe – from New Zealand to Samoa · Colin Heathcock – Fencing – from Germany to the USA · Dean Donny Huijsen Wijsmuller – ...Missing:  citizenship | Show results with:citizenship\",\"url\":\"https://olympics.com/ioc/news/ioc-executive-board-approves-11-athletes-changes-of-sporting-nationality-for-the-olympic-games-paris-2024\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"226\",\"title\":\"What Makes an Olympic Athlete Change Their Citizenship?\",\"description\":\"Jul 26, 2024 · Several athletes competing in this Summer's Olympics have changed their citizenship in order to do so. Here's what prompted that.Missing:  nationalities | Show results with:nationalities\",\"url\":\"https://www.insidehook.com/sports/olympic-athletes-citizenship-change\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"227\",\"title\":\"Effect of gender affirming hormones on athletic performance in ...\",\"description\":\"Study findings and prior research. Like previous studies, our study showed an association between testosterone and increased strength among transgender men.\",\"url\":\"https://bjsm.bmj.com/content/55/11/577\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"228\",\"title\":\"Sex differences and athletic performance. Where do trans ... - Frontiers\",\"description\":\"Oct 26, 2023 · This review seeks to offer considerations for whether trans individuals should be excluded from sports and athletics, and how future research should proceed.\u003c|control11|\u003e\u003c|separator|\u003e\",\"url\":\"https://www.frontiersin.org/journals/sports-and-active-living/articles/10.3389/fspor.2023.1224476/full\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"229\",\"title\":\"Munich massacre | Facts, Victims, Terrorism, Olympics, \u0026 History\",\"description\":\"Aug 29, 2025 · The Munich massacre was a terrorist attack on Israeli Olympic team members at the 1972 Summer Games in Munich orchestrated by affiliates of ...\",\"url\":\"https://www.britannica.com/event/Munich-Massacre\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"230\",\"title\":\"Massacre begins at Munich Olympics | September 5, 1972 | HISTORY\",\"description\":\"1972. Massacre begins at Munich Olympics. HISTORY.com Editors. Olympic Games in Munich 1972. picture alliance via Getty Image. Published: November 16, 2009 Last ...\",\"url\":\"https://www.history.com/this-day-in-history/september-5/massacre-begins-at-munich-olympics\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"231\",\"title\":\"50 years ago, Munich Olympics massacre changed how we ... - NPR\",\"description\":\"Sep 4, 2022 · The Munich massacre of Sept. 5 to 6, 1972, would have lasting repercussions on an international scale, waking up Western governments to the threat of terrorism.\",\"url\":\"https://www.npr.org/2022/09/04/1116641214/munich-olympics-massacre-hostage-terrorism-israel-germany\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"232\",\"title\":\"Olympic Park Bombing Fast Facts - CNN\",\"description\":\"Eric Robert Rudolph was convicted of the bombing. Timeline. July 27, 1996 - An anonymous 911 call warns that a bomb will explode in Centennial Olympic Park in ...\",\"url\":\"https://www.cnn.com/us/olympic-park-bombing-fast-facts\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"233\",\"title\":\"Eric Rudolph - FBI\",\"description\":\"As spectators watched the 1996 Summer Olympics, he planted a bomb in Centennial Olympic Park in Atlanta. ... - Replica of Centennial Bombing Backpack﻿ · Most ...\",\"url\":\"https://www.fbi.gov/history/famous-cases/eric-rudolph\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"234\",\"title\":\"- LESSONS LEARNED FROM SECURITY AT PAST OLYMPIC GAMES\",\"description\":\"On September 5, 1972, eight Palestinian terrorists broken into the apartments of the Olympic Village housing, of the Israeli athletes, and took nine hostages.\",\"url\":\"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/CHRG-108shrg20674/html/CHRG-108shrg20674.htm\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"235\",\"title\":\"Protecting Major Sporting Events from Terrorism: Considerations for ...\",\"description\":\"Jun 17, 2024 · This could explain why the Olympic Games have been targeted by terrorists, but the Paralympic Games have not. ... Olympics terrorist attack ...\",\"url\":\"https://ctc.westpoint.edu/protecting-major-sporting-events-from-terrorism-considerations-for-the-paris-olympics-and-beyond/\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"236\",\"title\":\"The Tokyo Olympic Games and the Risk of COVID-19 - PubMed\",\"description\":\"We reviewed the occurrence of outbreaks at past Olympics and discuss the threat of the COVID-19 pandemic at the Tokyo Games.\",\"url\":\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/33145147/\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"